WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.306 --> 00:00:07.921
The Ledger Evidence Report is a dated record of ledger facts, for auditors, boards and regulators.

2
00:00:09.324 --> 00:00:16.174
It covers the issuers, wallets and order books you choose, at a ledger you choose, with every reading reproducible.

3
00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:24.032
Pick a tier, list what should be covered, and order. Each tier shows exactly what it includes and what it costs.

4
00:00:25.298 --> 00:00:35.220
Pre-Sign Guard checks an XRPL transaction before it is signed. It refuses swapped destinations, key changes and counterfeit tokens.

5
00:00:36.624 --> 00:00:46.802
It runs as a Fireblocks co-signer callback, or as a check endpoint for any signing system. It is open source, so your security team can read every rule.

6
00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:51.740
Questions about any product? Write to institutions@noshashi.app.
